commit 235c9b6d23e11aac4df379164f13c1edf8580676
Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 2 03:06:05 2026 +0900

    fix: resolve all 13 TypeScript errors and update Phase 14 plan for blockers/warnings
    
    - Enable allowJs in tsconfig to support JavaScript module imports
    - Fix TS2741: add missing msb field to DivergenceRecord test fixtures
    - Fix TS2322: update deprecated divergence type values to current types
    - Fix TS7016: import declarations now typed with allowJs enabled
    - Remove unused @ts-expect-error directives
    - Add @ts-expect-error for immutability tests (frozen state assertions)
    
    Plan Updates (blockers & warnings):
    - B1: Add Task 14-03 for code review (SC7 requirement)
    - B2: TypeScript errors fixed in code (npm run typecheck now passes)
    - B3: Remove SC4 escape hatch - require runtime generation of index.html options
    - W1: Reframe 14-01-01/02 as verify/commit existing implementation
    - W2: Correct SC2 to '4 active modules' instead of '8+'
    - W3: Clarify admin.ts:38 should NOT convert to seconds
    - W4: Add negative assertion for zero scattered conversions

